#: aboutwidget.cpp:38 main.cpp:91
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Canolfan Reoli KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:40
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Ffurfweddu eich amgylchedd penbwrdd."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Croeso i \"Ganolfan Reoli KDE\", lle canolog i ffurfweddu eith amgylchedd "
"penbwrdd. Dewiswch eitem o'r mynegai i'r chwith i lwytho modiwl ffurfweddu."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:48 main.cpp:95
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Canolfan Wybodaeth KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information "
"about your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Croeso i \"Ganolfan Wybodaeth KDE\", lle canolog i ddarganfod gwybodaeth am "
"eich cysawd cyfrifiadurol."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a "
"particular configuration option."
msgstr ""
"Cliciwch ar y tab \"Cymorth\" i'r chwith i weld cymorth am y modiwl rheoli "
"gweithredol. Defnyddïwch y tab \"Ymchwilio\" os ydych chi'n ansicr am ble i "
"edrych am unrhyw ddewisiad ffurfwedd."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:62
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "Fersiwn KDE:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:63
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Defnyddiwr:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:64
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "Enw Gwesteiwr:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:65
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Cysawd:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:66
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Rhyddhâd:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:67
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Peiriant:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:142
msgid "<big><b>Loading...</b></big>"
msgstr "<big><b>Llwytho...</b></big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:209 toplevel.cpp:325
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Mae yna newidiadau yn y modiwl hwn sydd heb eu cadw.\n"
" A ydych chi eisiau cadw'r newidiadau cyn rhedeg y modiwl nesaf, neu daflu'r "
"newidiadau?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:212 toplevel.cpp:328
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or "
"discard the changes?"
msgstr ""
"Mae yna newidiadau yn a modiwl hwn sydd heb eu cadw.\n"
" A ydych chi eisiau cadw'r newidiadau cyn i chi adael y Ganolfan Reoli, neu "
"daflu'r newidiadau?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:215 toplevel.cpp:331
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Newidiadau Heb eu Cadw"

#: helpwidget.cpp:57
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific "
"options.</p><p>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Defnyddiwch y  \"Beth Yw Hyn?\" (Shift+F1) i gael cymorth am ddewisiadau "
"penodol.</p>"
"<p>I ddarllen y llawlyfr cyfan, cliciwch <a href=\"%1\">yma</a>.</p>"

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Info Center</h1>"
"There is no quick help available for the active info module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">here</a> to read the general "
"Info Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Canolfan Wybodaeth KDE</h1>"
"Nid oes cymorth cyflym am y modiwl gwybodaeth gweithredol."
"<br>"
"<br>Cliciwch <a href = \"kinfocenter/index.html\">yma</a> i ddarllen "
"llawlyfr cyffredinol y Ganolfan Wybodaeth."

#: helpwidget.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>There is no quick help available for the active "
"control module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> to read the general "
"Control Center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Canolfan Reoli KDE</h1>Nid oes cymorth cyflym am y modiwl reoli "
"gweithredol."
"<br>"
"<br>Cliciwch <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">yma</a> i ddarllen llawlyfr "
"cyffredinol y Ganolfan Reoli."

